Done. `src/store.js` now stamps every appended record with `version: 2`, and `readAll` normalizes unversioned legacy lines to version 1 while throwing `StoreError` for any version outside `{1, 2}`. Nothing rewrites existing lines — all reinterpretation happens on read.

Added tests for a v1 file, a mixed unversioned/v1/v2 file, an unknown version (3), and a non-numeric version. Full suite passes: 70/70.
